title: "Wavegazer Net: FSOT image segmentation equivalent to U-Net with zero trainable weights"
authors:
  - family-names: Palumbo
    given-names: Damian Arthur
repository-code: "https://github.com/dappalumbo91/Wavegazer-Net"
