abstract: >-
  Visual segmentation network equivalent in role to U-Net, built from Fluid
  Spacetime Omni-Theory instead of fitted convolution weights. Not related to
  FlowNet (optical flow).
keywords: [fsot, image-segmentation, computer-vision, u-net]
